:''This article is about the Cat unit, for the Enemy Unit, see [[Golem (Enemy)]] and [[Volcano Golem (Enemy)]].''
'''Golem''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that can be obtained as a [[Daily Bonus|Stamp Reward]] during the [[Castle & Dragon Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 4.6 Update|Version 4.6]]. [[True Form]] also added in Version 4.6 increased [[Slow]] chance.

{{Cat Info
|ID = 256
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Golem
|name2 = Rabbit Golem
|name3 = Volcano Golem
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Rabbit Golem''' at level 10.

Evolves into '''Volcano Golem''' when obtained from [[Road to Golem Evolution (Hard)|Road to Golem Evolution]] and is level 20 or above.

==Strategy/Usage==
Being the most expensive unit in the collab, his stats are very powerful for it; he is best used in [[Castle & Dragon Collaboration Event#Castle Dragon VS Castle Dragon|Castle Dragon VS Castle Dragon]] and early {{4c}} stages in [[Legend Stages|Stories of Legend]] where better alternatives are unavailable. Although his chance to slow all non-Floating enemies looks decent at first glance, his attack rate makes said ability very unreliable. Even with a fast attack rate, he would not be able to inflict the slow debuff all that well.

{{Job|Classification = User Rank Dump & Backliner}}

