*Prior to [[Version 12.6 Update|Version 12.6]], Golem was unlocked by completing the Beginner Stage in the Castle & Dragon app during the collab period.
*Golem being unable to slow Floating enemies references the fact that it couldn't target airborne enemies in its source game.

